meta {
  name: 6 Playlists
  seq: 6
}

docs {
  The playlists of the signed-in user, in order. Run **3 Library / List tracks** first: **Add tracks to playlist** uses the track it found (`trackId`) and the FLAC tracks (`opusTrackIds`). **Create playlist** remembers the new playlist (`playlistId`), **List playlist items** its last item (`playlistItemId`).

  Only the owner sees a playlist: for anyone else it is a 404. The two PATCH requests send `application/merge-patch+json`, as API Platform requires.
}
